OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 9 MAR
OL,4,G2255FThe Comedy Club Interview
OL,5,     GFrom 10pm until midnight, seven
OL,6,     Gdays a week, the Comedy Club has
OL,7,     Gtwo hours of comedy. Plus Rob
OL,8,     GDeering chats to drag queen
OL,9,     GGinger Johnson.
OL,10,G2300FThe Naked Week
OL,11,     GThe Naked Week team launch an
OL,12,     Gunprovoked attack on current
OL,13,     Gevents with a mix of
OL,14,     Gcorrespondents, guests and, on
OL,15,     Gthis occasion, a Town Crier
OL,16,     Gperforming the works of Amol
OL,17,     GRajan.
OL,18,G2330FThe Museum of Everything
OL,19,     GThe Elgin Tiddlywinks are among
OL,20,     Gthe exhibits on display. Stars
OL,21,     GMarcus Brigstocke and Dan
OL,22,     GTetsell. From April 2004.
