OL,4,G0000FAnd The Academy Award Goes To
OL,5,     FPaul Gambaccini reveals behind-
OL,6,     Fthe-scenes arguments, dubbings
OL,7,     Fand overruns of the 1961 film
OL,8,     Fthat won 10 Oscars
OL,9,     GFrom February 2009.
OL,10,G0030FOff The Page
OL,11,     GDominic Arkwright, Ben Goldacre,
OL,12,     GSophie Borland and Joe Queenan
OL,13,     Gdiscuss the cultural impact of
OL,14,     Gthe telephone. From November 2006.
OL,15,G0100FAgatha Raisin
OL,16,     GThe sleuth runs off to deepest
OL,17,     GCornwall, but even then there's
OL,18,     Gno escaping murder and mystery -
OL,19,     Gor James! Stars Penelope Keith.
